# Wymaga sesji ADMIN — uruchom Signin z auth.http

### Lista zespołu
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Zaproś managera
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

### Zmień dane lub rolę
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/WKLEJ_USER_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Usuń użytkownika
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/WKLEJ_USER_ID
Origin: {{origin}}
